OL,3,GNEWSA'My boss stabbed me, left prison
OL,4,Aearly but no one told me for months'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHannah Pritchett was 18 when she was
OL,7,Fstabbed in the lower back and hip by
OL,8,Fher boss Luisa Santos.
OL,10,FShe was about an hour into her
OL,11,Fwaitressing shift in May 2022 at the
OL,12,FThree Horseshoes pub in Princethorpe,
OL,13,FWarwickshire, when the blade went in.
OL,14,FIt was a fish knife, and with its cuts
OL,15,Fcame Santos's false accusation the teen
OL,16,Fhad had an affair with her husband.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
