OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSA'My boss stabbed me, left prison
OL,4,Aearly but no one told me for months'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThat October, Santos was jailed for 10
OL,7,Fyears after being convicted of
OL,8,Fattempted murder. She was released in
OL,9,FJanuary 2026 under the Early Removal
OL,10,FScheme, which allows foreign national
OL,11,Finmates in England and Wales, under
OL,12,Fcertain criteria, to exit prison before
OL,13,Fthey would have previously been allowed
OL,14,Ffor the purpose of deportation.
OL,16,FPritchett did not know of her
OL,17,Fattacker's departure from prison until
OL,18,Ffive months after the fact. Sharing
OL,19,Fwith the BBC the scheme's effect on
OL,20,Fher, she said she had been made to feel
OL,21,Flike an "afterthought", which was "just
OL,22,Fappalling".
